          {
            "pdfPage": 60,
            "printedPage": 52
          }
        ],
        "text": "(To Garudan) He spoke that much at the meeting, and you just listened and came away...hmm...",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s046-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s046-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 60,
            "printedPage": 52
          }
        ],
        "text": "What can I do, man? I'm only one person.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s046-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s046-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 60,
            "printedPage": 52
          }
        ],
        "text": "Pomp, newspaper publicity, 'Victory to Paranthaman'... he has attacked me directly.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s046-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s046-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 60,
            "printedPage": 52
          }
        ],
        "text": "The attack itself doesn't matter. He has even spoken about that five-thousand matter.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s046-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s046-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 60,
            "printedPage": 52
          }
        ],
        "text": "Pandiyan! An enemy inside my own house! He must not walk around alive.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s046-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s046-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 61,
            "printedPage": 53
          }
        ],
        "text": "Even if he walks around as a corpse, it will be dangerous to your greatness.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s046-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s046-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 61,
            "printedPage": 53
          }
        ],
        "text": "I'll finish it. I'll finish it today itself.",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
